= docs: unit artifact milestone 1 -- plan, rulings, ledger, reports
The milestone-1 implementation plan (nqp stage2 as artifacts) and the rulings taken during it:
the eval server is milestone 3's vehicle, not milestone 1's gate; NQP_UNIT is all-or-nothing;
static lexical rows after serialize; the spec's final-review corrections (entry order, resume
road, wrapper ops, backtraces open). The Truffle-only plan records item 4 scheduled after
milestone 3 and the post-completion gate green (Rakudo builds on the artifact nqp, t/01-sanity
25/25). The SDD ledger and the per-task briefs and implementer reports kept beside the plan.
